        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kate Bosworth, Robert Redford, Nicholas Evans\n- Works: The Horse Whisperer, Remember the Titans, Blue Crush\n- Topics: acting, modeling, film debut\n\nFacts:\n- Kate Bosworth was born on January 2, 1983, and she is an American actress and model.\n- Nicholas Evans wrote the 1995 novel \"The Horse Whisperer.\"\n- The 1998 American drama film \"The Horse Whisperer\" was directed by Robert Redford, starred Robert Redford, and was based on Nicholas Evans's 1995 novel.\n- Kate Bosworth made her film debut in \"The Horse Whisperer\" in 1998.\n- Kate Bosworth appeared in \"Remember the Titans\" in 2000.\n- Kate Bosworth played a lead role as a teenage surfer in the box-office hit \"Blue Crush\" in 2002.",
